      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Benchmarking": {
        "mds:value": "pvwatts and system advisor model (SAM)",
        "mds:quote": "The comparison was made between data from a real system, a simplified version of the system built with Pvsyst software , and another version where performance ratio from different commercial tools was used, in this case PV-SOL and other sources to assess the accuracy of each of these tools. Robledo et al., 2019."
      },
