        "mds:value": "central grid-connected system"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Benchmarking": {
        "mds:value": "no benchmark values available"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/ByPass": {
        "mds:value": "diode-based bypass system used in the solar module"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Cable": {
        "mds:value": "2m long, with each conductor insulated from ground and other conductors"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Calibration": {
        "mds:value": "accuracy of 4.99 %"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Capacity": {
        "mds:value": "5 kW"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Cell": {
        "mds:value": "PV cell with a fill factor of 76.37% and an efficiency of 15.12%"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Chamber": {
        "mds:value": "enclosure used in the solar panel assembly"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Climate": {
        "mds:value": "climate zones A2 to D1"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/ClosedCircuit": {
        "mds:value": "closed circuit type system, with grid connected power supply as the main energy source"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Coatings": {
        "mds:value": "with Si3N4 coating to reduce heat dissipation and prevent module overheating"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Condition": {
        "mds:value": "system is in good working condition"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Connection": {
        "mds:value": "junction boxes with MPE rated current rating up to 16A"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Conversion": {
        "mds:value": "DC-to-AC power conversion module has a efficiency of 95% and is used in conjunction with an inverter"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Damage": {
        "mds:value": "the system would suffer damage if temperature exceeds 50°C for about 2 hours."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Design": {
        "mds:value": "central grid-connected system with micro-grid capacity to supply power to the surrounding load"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Diode": {
        "mds:value": "high-temperature diode used for bypass systems in solar panel assemblies and at temperature below -10°C an IGBT-based MPPT charger is recommended"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Efficiency": {
        "mds:value": "with an efficiency of 18.24% when operated at the maximum power point and under STC conditions, which corresponds to a fill factor of 78.47%"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Emitter": {
        "mds:value": "non-metallic (plastic) or metallic emitter layer on the silicon surface to facilitate electron injection from the contact into the emitter layer."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Error": {
        "mds:value": "The model assumes that the temperature difference is less than two percent for each hour considered for operation, hence any error margin should not exceed that value."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Exertion": {
        "mds:value": "no exertion needed to operate the system as it is designed on an automatic mode"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/FillFactor": {
        "mds:value": "76.32%"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Gauge": {
        "mds:value": "anode and cathode terminals gauge the resistance, temperature and open-circuit voltage measurement using a multi-meter."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Infrared": {
        "mds:value": "no emission of infrared radiation, allowing the system to be used in high and low temperature conditions"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/InputOutput": {
        "mds:value": "system has input/output connections using high-temperature wires which can withstand up to 150°C and are designed for direct connection to the system's control unit, and in addition, there are two sets of sensors that measure the photovoltaic current as well as temperature at different locations on the panel."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Insulation": {
        "mds:value": "the entire system is designed and insulated to prevent the occurrence of any electrical or thermal malfunction due to environmental temperature changes."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Interconnect": {
        "mds:value": "PV module interconnection cabling has an insulation resistance of >5000Mohms and a dielectric strength of at least 5.7 kV per millimeter under test conditions."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Irradiance": {
        "mds:value": "system designed with optimal irradiation factor, ensuring efficiency up to 18.24% when operated in STC condition and maximum power point tracker operation"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Lifetime": {
        "mds:value": "estimated lifetime of the system is ten years from commencement of its deployment."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Location": {
        "mds:value": "the system designed to operate for long periods, with solar irradiance intensity estimated at STC conditions and other locations with an average temperature ranging between 15 C and 45 C."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Maintenance": {
        "mds:value": "The maintenance interval for the system includes checking cable connections every 6 months, and any defects can be easily identified using this routine check."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Measurement": {
        "mds:value": "system is designed with built-in voltage and current sensors for monitoring the output and input parameters, respectively."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/MemoryBank": {
        "mds:value": ",memory bank in which the control unit stores data to track history of past operations in order to make prediction on future performance based"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Microchip": {
        "mds:value": "the system employs a high temperature-rated microchip installed inside the module. The controller ensures continuous flow of input power when the module is shaded partially."
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Module": {
        "mds:value": "crystalline silicon pv solar module"
      },
      "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/Nonlinearity": {
        "mds:value": ",nonlinear relationship between voltage output and input at maximum allowable temperatures. However, in this case the system can accommodate high levels of irradiation above the standard rating without suffering any damage to the panel components."
      },
